<![CDATA[<div style=""><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Hello {!Apttus__APTS_Agreement__c.OwnerFullName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Your Agreement has been approved and is now with the Legal team for final review. Details:</font></div><div style=""><ul style=""><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Agreement Number:</b>{!Apttus__APTS_Agreement__c.Apttus__FF_Agreement_Number__c}</font></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Agreement Name:</b> {!Apttus__APTS_Agreement__c.Name}</font></li><li style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b>Account:&nbsp;</b></font><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Apttus__APTS_Agreement__c.Apttus__Account__c}</font></li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">View the Agreement record here:</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ul><li><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Link:</b> {!Apttus__APTS_Agreement__c.Link}&nbsp;</font></li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Thank you,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Conga CLM</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
